    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Held captive by the abandoned Signal Creek Shopping Mall, Nour and her companions must come to terms with their deepest regrets or lose themselves to the Void.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1744297207\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal Creek is a narrative-driven RPG set in a surreal pixel art world. Playing as Nour, a 24-year-old photography student, you will guide your companions through a journey of reconciliation with the past  while searching for a way to escape an abandoned (\u2026sentient?) shopping mall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a surreal abandoned mall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped with your younger brother's best friend and your professional mentor in a place that\u2019s right out of your strangest dreams. Search the top floor of the mall to find objects and interact with characters that may hold the keys to your escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reconcile with past mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nick through his growing pains and Ms. Gaw deal with old friends as you face an old friendship gone sour\u2014 these elements of your pasts have somehow materialized in the alternate reality of the mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the missing apple prince...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three old (or new?) spaces that house a colorful cast of NPCs! What kind of mall trip would it be without a glitchy uwu-tastic store manager, a troupe of talking (regal) apples, and some guy named Tim wearing shoes on his hands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1744297207\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Held captive by the abandoned Signal Creek Shopping Mall, Nour and her companions must come to terms with their deepest regrets or lose themselves to the Void.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1744297207\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Signal Creek is a narrative-driven RPG set in a surreal pixel art world. Playing as Nour, a 24-year-old photography student, you will guide your companions through a journey of reconciliation with the past  while searching for a way to escape an abandoned (\u2026sentient?) shopping mall. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a surreal abandoned mall</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped with your younger brother's best friend and your professional mentor in a place that\u2019s right out of your strangest dreams. Search the top floor of the mall to find objects and interact with characters that may hold the keys to your escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reconcile with past mistakes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Nick through his growing pains and Ms. Gaw deal with old friends as you face an old friendship gone sour\u2014 these elements of your pasts have somehow materialized in the alternate reality of the mall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find the missing apple prince...?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover three old (or new?) spaces that house a colorful cast of NPCs! What kind of mall trip would it be without a glitchy uwu-tastic store manager, a troupe of talking (regal) apples, and some guy named Tim wearing shoes on his hands?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2505460/extras/81b5f94c90baac4b13b16694d61bdce7.webp?t=1744297207\" /></span></p>",
